caption: Paladins

Holy warriors have both divine power and martial prowess. They require a warrior’s Code of Honor in addition to their core Vow, and can use both as a discount to all of their primary attributes. They gain Clerical magic, similar to a priest, but without the ability to change out their spells: they only have those spells they purchase.
